WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A target wanders through one dimension; the dashed line is its true position, step by step.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A noisy position sensor reports on most steps and stays silent on about one in five.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
One fusion up close: the wide predicted belief meets a reading, and the gain K narrows the posterior between them.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Run the whole episode: the estimate drifts through each dropout and corrects on each reading, staying close to the truth.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Predict widens the belief, update narrows it; that alternation, repeated forever, is the filter.
